OL,3,AFarmers down 240 million litres of milk
OL,4,Aafter heat
OL,5,
OL,6,FExtreme heat this summer has led to
OL,7,Fdairy farmers delivering 240 million
OL,8,Ffewer litres of milk than expected,
OL,9,Fresearchers have said.
OL,11,FFarmers delivered four fewer days of
OL,12,Fmilk supply than would be expected
OL,13,Fbetween May and August, according to
OL,14,Fthe Energy and Climate Intelligence
OL,15,FUnit (ECIU).
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,110,105,200,300,0,100
