OL,3,AFarmers down 240 million litres of milk
OL,4,Aafter heat
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith the heat leading to poor grazing
OL,7,Fconditions, stunted harvests and heat
OL,8,Fstrain on livestock in England and
OL,9,FWales, many farmers have started giving
OL,10,Fwinter feed to cattle, including Debbie
OL,11,FWilkins, a dairy and beef farmer in
OL,12,FGloucestershire.
OL,14,F"The costs pile up when you have to
OL,15,Fbring the cows indoors and the loss of
OL,16,Fmilk production compounds the issue,"
OL,17,Fshe said.
